{"id":"a9cc276acce13e0d","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-srandom-weak.md","title":"强 s 随机蕴含弱 s 随机","display":"thm-srandom-weak — 强 s 随机蕴含弱 s 随机","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-srandom-weak","aliases":["43-thm-srandom-weak"],"display":"thm-srandom-weak — 强 s 随机蕴含弱 s 随机","depends_on":["[[43-df-srandom]]","[[43-df-weak-srandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Defs.17.4.1,17.4.6, printed pp.518,520 / PDF pp.538,540","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-srandom-weak"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-srandom-weak</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-srandom-weak — 强 s 随机蕴含弱 s 随机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7b7bb0c1682f4d07\" href=\"?note=7b7bb0c1682f4d07\" title=\"43-df-srandom\">43-df-srandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1fddb2090fe6a3d\" href=\"?note=a1fddb2090fe6a3d\" title=\"43-df-weak-srandom\">43-df-weak-srandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Defs.17.4.1,17.4.6, printed pp.518,520 / PDF pp.538,540"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7b7bb0c1682f4d07\" href=\"?note=7b7bb0c1682f4d07\" title=\"43-df-srandom\">43-df-srandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1fddb2090fe6a3d\" href=\"?note=a1fddb2090fe6a3d\" title=\"43-df-weak-srandom\">43-df-weak-srandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongSRandom}_s(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{WeakSRandom}_s(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StrongSRandom}_s(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{WeakSRandom}_s(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：每个弱测试的任意前缀自由子集权重不超过整集权重，因此每个弱测试都是强测试；避免将两类测试的包含方向倒置。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-srandom","status":"resolved","id":"7b7bb0c1682f4d07","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-srandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak-srandom","status":"resolved","id":"a1fddb2090fe6a3d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-weak-srandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-srandom","status":"resolved","id":"7b7bb0c1682f4d07","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-srandom]]、[[43-df-weak-srandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak-srandom","status":"resolved","id":"a1fddb2090fe6a3d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]$，$X\\